      "_key": "k0006",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "On Monday, May 2, O3 World Developer Courtney Wilburn will join a panel of Philadelphia’s tech and entrepreneurship community leaders to speak with Mayor Jim Kenney about his priorities and theirs when it comes to tech issues, including an open data policy, small business support, workforce development, and more.",
