    },
    {
      "_key": "k0011",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If you’re looking to build a meaningful company culture, check out ",
          "_key": "k0012"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0001"
          ],
          "text": "“Creating Culture with Purpose (The Marshmallow Challenge)”",
          "_key": "k0013"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " – a conversation about how great company cultures are imagined, built, and maintained with purposeful planning. O3 World Partner and CEO Keith Scandone will join this Philly Tech Week panel at Leadnomics/Margo offices on Tuesday, May 3. Learn more about the panel, then register!",
          "_key": "k0014"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0001",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "http://2016.phillytechweek.com/events/creating_culture_with_purpose-the_marshmallow_challenge"
